<div class="attacker-diagram" role="img" aria-label="Conceptual attacker path. A malicious or replacement file-system filter may reach protected storage and encrypted fragments. That reach does not automatically supply the information to identify the correct fragments, the required cryptographic material, or the protected decryption and reconstruction processes. Replacing or bypassing an ordinary file-system driver does not by itself reproduce Cyber Reliant reconstruction. This is not a claim of immunity to kernel-level attack.">
